lor 2, including line intersections. Preserve all cells not on a complete separator line. Validate that the detected lines separate patterned regions and that no partial line is recolored; the rule solved the test correctly.","path":"general","scope":"global","reference":{},"arguments":{},"metadata":{"scope":"global"},"source":"refine","created_at":"2026-09-29T13:32:55.950413+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-29T14:36:38.538Z","version":2},"after":{"id":"arc_task_37954567_recolor_full_separator_lines","kind":"memory","title":"ARC task-37954567: recolor every complete uniform row and column","content":"For ARC task-37954567, identify every complete horizontal row and vertical column whose cells are all the same color, regardless of that color, and recolor every cell on each such line to 2. Preserve all cells not on a qualifying line. Demo evidence: vertical columns 0 and 4 and horizontal rows 5 and 15 were recolored. Accepted test: horizontal rows 7, 14, and 16 and vertical columns 12 and 17 were recolored. A first attempt that changed only the horizontal rows was incorrect; scanning both orientations found the omitted columns. Recolor the union of qualifying rows and columns, including intersections, and check both orientations before submission.","path":"general","scope":"global","reference":{},"arguments":{},"metadata":{"scope":"global"},"source":"refine","created_at":"2026-09-29T13:32:55.950413+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-29T14:57:24.020Z","version":3},"applied":true}],"harnessStatePath":"/home/ubuntu/continual-arc-baselines/.workbench/runs/adhoc-primeagentlearner-1790682203/attempts/5aeabceef638470ab98c0ce83fca400e/system/state/agent/harness/harness_state.json","scope":"global"}
